# Real bounded executor, intercepted model transport, synthetic observations.
name: Usage evidence makes spending tradeoffs visible and survives restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_usage.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/future-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 planned | finite-future-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | saved-plan-and-spending
expect: 4 committed / 6 total
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Observed: | usage-evidence
expect: provider requests
ask: Can the operator distinguish observed requests, unknown dollars and uncertain projection while seeing unchanged shared spending?
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 20 Usage evidence: | exact-evidence-identity
ask: Does the basis retain the original model, source and run identity without implying future charges are guaranteed?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: usage-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: usage-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: usage-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: usage-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: usage-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: usage-tail-40x12
ask: At 40x12, are all usage details reachable with visible paging, back and next controls and intact frame corners?
resize: 120x36
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | exact-plan-approval
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-last
ask: Does approval disclose the shared remaining calls and projection uncertainty before the operator chooses to spend, with no automatic limit increase?
keys: n
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | cancelled-approval
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_usage.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 BATCH usage-future | original-campaign
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/future-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 planned | saved-unstarted-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | restored-usage-plan
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Observed: | usage-after-restart
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_usage.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does actual no-color restart restore the same chosen baseline and approved spending, without new requests, allowance approval or discovery starts?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 BATCH usage-future | restored-origin
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
